    (https://universe.roboflow.com/domin-td1ad/site-dataset-vrazk). Attribution: see docs/DATASET.md.
  - PyTorch and torchvision: distributed under their own software licences.
  - torchvision COCO-pretrained weights used for initialisation: "may have their own licenses or terms and conditions
    derived from the dataset used for training" (torchvision documentation).
  - Ultralytics (used only for the YOLOv8m and RT-DETR-L reference runs): AGPL-3.0 or Ultralytics Enterprise licence.
    The core Faster R-CNN pipeline (core/) does not depend on Ultralytics.
